{
  "_purpose": "Dimension/utility data elements carried over 1:1 from the source property AboutAmazon-US (Launch Inspector export, build 2025-08-05). Names are kept identical to the source so payload references (%Name%) and the client team's mental model survive the migration. Consumed by scripts/generate-blueprint.mjs.",
  "_source": "aboutamazon.com.xlsx \u2014 DataElements sheet (108 elements; 72 carried, 28 XDM replaced by generated builders, remainder excluded with reasons below)",
